  "text": "Nemed is a legendary leader of early Irish settlers. His kinsfolk left their ancestral home in Scythia and came behind him. Together they migrated to Ireland. Some scholars read such invasion myths as faint memory of history that is now lost. The Nemed entries also carry a cross-reference to the goddess Macha.",
